graph LR
    OMC["odh-model-controller<br/>(manager + model-serving-api)"]

    %% Internal platform dependencies
    OMC -->|CRD watch/patch, admission| KServe[KServe<br/>ISVC, LLMISVC, ServingRuntime, InferenceGraph]
    OMC -->|DSC/DSCI watch| Operator[opendatahub / rhods operator]
    Operator -->|deploys manifests + params| OMC
    OMC -->|CRD read| HWP[HardwareProfile]
    OMC -->|Gateway watch, EnvoyFilter CRUD| Istio[Gateway API / Istio OSSM]
    OMC -->|AuthPolicy CRUD, watch| Kuadrant[Kuadrant / Authorino]
    OMC -->|TriggerAuthentication CRUD| KEDA[KEDA]
    OMC -->|ServiceMonitor/PodMonitor CRUD| Prom[Prometheus / UWM]
    OMC -.->|optional REST HTTPS| MR[Model Registry]
    OMC -->|InferenceProvider CRUD| Grid["Grid (grid.praxis.fast)"]
    OMC -->|Route CRUD| Router[OpenShift Router]
    OMC -->|serving-cert annotation| ServiceCA[OpenShift service-ca]
    OMC -->|TLS profile watch| APIServer[OpenShift APIServer config]

    %% Consumers
    Dashboard[RHOAI Dashboard] -->|HTTPS 8443 Gateway discovery, samples| OMC

    %% External services
    OMC -->|HTTPS 443 NIM validation| NGC[NVIDIA NGC / nvcr.io]
    OMC -->|HTTPS 6443| K8sAPI[Kubernetes API]
    OMC -.->|optional OTLP/gRPC| OTel[OpenTelemetry Collector]

    %% Go libraries
    subgraph Libs["Key Go libraries"]
        CR[controller-runtime v0.25.2]
        CG[client-go v0.37.1]
        KSLib[kserve v0.17.0-rc1]
        GWLib[gateway-api v1.6.2]
        IstioLib[istio client-go v1.31.2]
        KuadLib[kuadrant-operator v1.4.2]
        KEDALib[keda v2.20.2]
        OCPLib[openshift api / library-go]
        OTelLib[otel v1.45.0]
    end
    OMC -.->|built with| Libs

